  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 511.05 Fleet Registrant",
  "priorExpiration": "2012-03-15",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 511.05 Fleet Registrant. A registrant shall be provided with renewal registration applications prior to the registrant’s month of renewal if the registrant will be renewing 100 or more registrations, and the registrant requests early registration, in writing or in person, from the department at least 60 days prior to the registrant’s month of renewal.\n\nSource. #7972, eff 10-17-03 (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500); ss by #9995, INTERIM, eff 9-17-11, EXPIRED: 3-15-12\n\nNew. #10135, eff 5-23-12; ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 512.06)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c500.html"
